None of `tools/ingest/dedupe.py`, `tools/ingest/test_dedupe.py`, or any trace of the diff described exists in the designated working repository -- not in the working tree, not committed, not in any other branch, not stashed. The repository's only commit and only file is `docs/DOD.md` (a fixture explicitly self-described as "used only to exercise the verification-before-completion skill's Definition of Done completion-gate check").

